{"id": "aaa0a8c6-49e4-4b77-971c-96ce297e196b", "slug": "authentication-architecture", "title": "Authentication Architecture", "description": "Authentication Architecture Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Authentication Architecture\"\ndescription: \"Authentication Architecture Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#34D399\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#5865F2\"\n  background: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  surface: \"#191C21\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#333333\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"15px\"\n  control: \"15px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Authentication Architecture\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 241; favorites: 16; remixes: 7.\nTags: login, animated, security, input, validation, effect.\n## Overview\nAuthentication Architecture Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nUnified architecture for secure authentication Frictionless passwordless entry, adaptive multi-factor security, and granular access control — engineered for enterprise-grade deployments and institutional architectures.…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Unified architecture for secure authentication; Federated Identity Hubs; Native Authentication UI; Isolated Data Sovereignty.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #34D399, secondary #000000, accent #5865F2, background #0A0A0A, surface #191C21, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Authentication Architecture</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden flex items-center justify-center font-sans selection:bg-white/20 antialiased\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Background Ambient Glow -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-center items-center\">\n        <div class=\"w-[80vw] h-[80vh] rounded-full bg-white/[0.015] blur-[120px]\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Skill Directive: Container Lines -->\n    <main class=\"relative w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-24 sm:py-32 z-10 border-x border-white/[0.04]\">\n        <!-- Container Corner Squares -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 -ml-[2.5px] -mt-[2.5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-white/20 bg-[#0a0a0a]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-[2.5px] -mt-[2.5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-white/20 bg-[#0a0a0a]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 -ml-[2.5px] -mb-[2.5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-white/20 bg-[#0a0a0a]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 -mr-[2.5px] -mb-[2.5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-white/20 bg-[#0a0a0a]\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Header Section -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between items-start lg:items-center gap-8 mb-16 lg:mb-24\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight leading-[1.15]\">\n                <span class=\"text-neutral-500 block mb-1\">Unified architecture</span>\n                <span class=\"text-neutral-100\">for secure authentication</span>\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-400 font-light max-w-xl leading-relaxed lg:text-right\">\n                Frictionless passwordless entry, adaptive multi-factor security, and granular access control — engineered for enterprise-grade deployments and institutional architectures.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Cards Grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n\n            <!-- Card 1: Social Providers -->\n            <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/[0.08] to-transparent hover:from-white/30 hover:to-white/5 transition-colors duration-500 p-[1px] shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]\">\n                <!-- Dynamic Hover Flashlight -->\n                <div class=\"flashlight absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"h-full bg-[#111111] rounded-[15px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col relative z-10\">\n\n                    <!-- Visual Area -->\n                    <div class=\"h-64 sm:h-72 w-full relative flex items-center justify-center bg-black/20 overflow-hidden border-b border-white/[0.03]\">\n                        <!-- Radial Fade Mask -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at center, transparent 30%, #111111 80%);\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Icon Grid Container -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-60 transition-all duration-1000 ease-out\">\n                            <div id=\"icon-grid\" class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 sm:gap-4 w-full px-8 justify-center items-center\">\n                                <!-- Row 1 -->\n                                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-5 gap-3 sm:gap-4 justify-items-center\">\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:apple-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:ghost-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hashtag-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:link-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Row 2 -->\n                                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-5 gap-3 sm:gap-4 justify-items-center\">\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:figma-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-circle-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:letter-opened-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:lock-keyhole-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Row 3 -->\n                                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-5 gap-3 sm:gap-4 justify-items-center\">\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:global-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:devices-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:gamepad-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cloud-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Row 4 -->\n                                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-5 gap-3 sm:gap-4 justify-items-center\">\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:monitor-smartphone-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-circle-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                    <div class=\"icon-item transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center relative\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:keyboard-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Text Area -->\n                    <div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-end\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-normal text-neutral-200 mb-2\">Federated Identity Hubs</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-500 font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                            Integrate seamlessly with universal social providers and enterprise SAML setups for immediate, single-click access.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2: Fully Integrated UI -->\n            <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/[0.08] to-transparent hover:from-white/30 hover:to-white/5 transition-colors duration-500 p-[1px] shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]\">\n                <!-- Dynamic Hover Flashlight -->\n                <div class=\"flashlight absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"h-full bg-[#111111] rounded-[15px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col relative z-10\">\n\n                    <!-- Visual Area -->\n                    <div class=\"h-64 sm:h-72 w-full relative flex items-center justify-center bg-black/20 overflow-hidden border-b border-white/[0.03]\">\n                        <!-- Background Grid lines -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to right, #333 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, #333 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px;\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- UI Mockup Container -->\n                        <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[220px] h-[300px] mt-12 group-hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out\">\n\n                            <!-- Mockup Card 1: Register -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-0 w-full bg-[#18181b] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] z-20 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                                <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 mx-auto\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"text-center mb-4\">\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white mb-1\">Establish connection</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light scale-90 origin-top\">Supply valid credentials.</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"h-8 w-full bg-white/5 border border-white/5 rounded-md flex items-center px-3\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 scale-90 origin-left\">Continue with SSO</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"h-8 w-full bg-white/5 border border-white/5 rounded-md flex items-center px-3\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 scale-90 origin-left\">Continue with OAuth</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Mockup Card 2: Password Reset (Layered Behind) -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-40 w-full bg-[#18181b] border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] z-10 opacity-70 scale-95 group-hover:top-44 group-hover:scale-100 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-700 ease-out\">\n                                <div class=\"text-center mb-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white mb-1\">Restore account</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light scale-90 origin-top\">Regenerate access token</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"h-8 w-full bg-black/50 border border-white/10 rounded-md flex items-center px-3\">\n                                        <span id=\"login-dots\" class=\"text-xs tracking-widest text-neutral-600\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div id=\"login-btn\" class=\"h-8 w-full bg-white/10 border border-transparent text-white flex items-center justify-center rounded-md transition-all duration-200\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-xs font-normal scale-90\">Confirm Updates</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Text Area -->\n                    <div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-end\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-normal text-neutral-200 mb-2\">Native Authentication UI</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-500 font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                            Deploy drop-in login components, intelligent routing, and account recovery flows directly within your application.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 3: Own Your Data -->\n            <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/[0.08] to-transparent hover:from-white/30 hover:to-white/5 transition-colors duration-500 p-[1px] shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]\">\n                <!-- Dynamic Hover Flashlight -->\n                <div class=\"flashlight absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"h-full bg-[#111111] rounded-[15px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col relative z-10\">\n\n                    <!-- Visual Area -->\n                    <div class=\"h-64 sm:h-72 w-full relative flex items-center justify-center bg-black/20 overflow-hidden border-b border-white/[0.03]\">\n\n                        <!-- Radar Concentric Rings -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-50 transition-opacity duration-1000\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute w-[150%] aspect-square border border-white/[0.03] rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute w-[110%] aspect-square border border-white/[0.05] rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute w-[70%] aspect-square border border-white/[0.08] rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute w-[30%] aspect-square border border-white/[0.1] rounded-full\"></div>\n                            <!-- Crosshairs -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute w-full h-[1px] bg-white/[0.03]\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute h-full w-[1px] bg-white/[0.03]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Shield SVG Graphic Animated -->\n                        <div id=\"shield-wrapper\" class=\"relative z-20 flex items-center justify-center\">\n\n                            <!-- Dynamic Sonar Animation Rings -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\">\n                                <div id=\"sonar-1\" class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full border-2 border-emerald-400 opacity-0 mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\">\n                                <div id=\"sonar-2\" class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full border border-emerald-400/50 opacity-0 mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-in-out\">\n                                <!-- Glow Effect behind shield -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-500/20 blur-[30px] rounded-full mix-blend-screen opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n\n                                <svg width=\"100\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 120\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"relative z-10\">\n                                    <defs>\n                                        <pattern id=\"dotPattern\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"4\" height=\"4\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n                                            <circle cx=\"1\" cy=\"1\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#10b981\" opacity=\"0.6\"/>\n                                        </pattern>\n                                        <linearGradient id=\"shieldGrad\" x1=\"50\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"120\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n                                            <stop stop-color=\"#34d399\" />\n                                            <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#059669\" stop-opacity=\"0.2\" />\n                                        </linearGradient>\n                                    </defs>\n\n                                    <!-- Main Shield Path -->\n                                    <path d=\"M50 0L95 15V55C95 85 75 110 50 120C25 110 5 85 5 55V15L50 0Z\" fill=\"url(#shieldGrad)\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\"/>\n                                    <!-- Dotted overlay -->\n                                    <path d=\"M50 0L95 15V55C95 85 75 110 50 120C25 110 5 85 5 55V15L50 0Z\" fill=\"url(#dotPattern)\"/>\n                                    <!-- Stroke Outline -->\n                                    <path d=\"M50 0.5L94.5 15.34V55C94.5 84.66 74.75 109.34 50 119.26C25.25 109.34 5.5 84.66 5.5 55V15.34L50 0.5Z\" stroke=\"#6ee7b7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-opacity=\"0.8\"/>\n                                    <!-- Inner subtle detail line -->\n                                    <path d=\"M50 10L85 22V55C85 78 68 98 50 106C32 98 15 78 15 55V22L50 10Z\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-opacity=\"0.4\" fill=\"none\"/>\n                                </svg>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Text Area -->\n                    <div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-end\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-normal text-neutral-200 mb-2\">Isolated Data Sovereignty</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-500 font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                            Maintain strict compliance by anchoring credential storage to dedicated, regionally isolated environments.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // Dynamic Mouse-Position Flashlight Setup\n        document.querySelectorAll('.group').forEach(card => {\n            const flashlight = card.querySelector('.flashlight');\n            if (flashlight) {\n                card.addEventListener('mousemove', e => {\n                    const rect = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    const x = e.clientX - rect.left;\n                    const y = e.clientY - rect.top;\n                    flashlight.style.background = `radial-gradient(circle at ${x}px ${y}px, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%)`;\n                });\n                card.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                    flashlight.style.background = `radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%)`;\n                });\n            }\n        });\n\n        const shieldWrapper = document.getElementById('shield-wrapper');\n        const loginDots = document.getElementById('login-dots');\n        const loginBtn = document.getElementById('login-btn');\n        const sonar1 = document.getElementById('sonar-1');\n        const sonar2 = document.getElementById('sonar-2');\n\n        // Icon Loop Setup\n        const icons = document.querySelectorAll('.icon-item');\n        const targetIndices = [2, 11, 7, 16, 14, 5, 18];\n        const activeClasses = ['bg-[#5865F2]/20', 'border-[#5865F2]/50', 'text-[#5865F2]', 'shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]', 'scale-125', 'z-20'];\n        const inactiveClasses = ['bg-white/5', 'border-transparent', 'text-white', 'scale-100', 'z-0'];\n        let lastStep = -1;\n\n        const startTime = Date.now();\n\n        function animateLoop() {\n            const elapsed = Date.now() - startTime;\n\n            // 1. Floating Shield Animation\n            if (shieldWrapper) {\n                shieldWrapper.style.transform = `translateY(${Math.sin(elapsed / 600) * 6}px)`;\n            }\n\n            // 2. Shield Sonar Animation\n            if (sonar1 && sonar2) {\n                const s1 = (elapsed % 3000) / 3000;\n                sonar1.style.transform = `scale(${1 + s1 * 2})`;\n                sonar1.style.opacity = Math.max(0, 1 - s1).toFixed(2);\n\n                const s2 = ((elapsed + 1500) % 3000) / 3000;\n                sonar2.style.transform = `scale(${1 + s2 * 2})`;\n                sonar2.style.opacity = Math.max(0, 1 - s2).toFixed(2);\n            }\n\n            // 3. Active Icon Loop\n            if (icons.length > 0) {\n                const currentStep = Math.floor(elapsed / 2000) % targetIndices.length;\n                if (currentStep !== lastStep) {\n                    icons.forEach((icon, index) => {\n                        if (index === targetIndices[currentStep]) {\n                            icon.classList.remove(...inactiveClasses);\n                            icon.classList.add(...activeClasses);\n                        } else {\n                            icon.classList.remove(...activeClasses);\n                            icon.classList.add(...inactiveClasses);\n                        }\n                    });\n                    lastStep = currentStep;\n                }\n            }\n\n            // 4. Simulated Login Sequence\n            if (loginDots && loginBtn) {\n                const cycle = elapsed % 5500;\n\n                // Typing Phase\n                if (cycle < 800) {\n                    loginDots.textContent = '';\n                } else if (cycle < 1100) {\n                    loginDots.textContent = '•';\n                } else if (cycle < 1400) {\n                    loginDots.textContent = '•••';\n                } else if (cycle < 1700) {\n                    loginDots.textContent = '••••••';\n                } else if (cycle < 2200) {\n                    loginDots.textContent = '••••••••';\n                }\n\n                // Clicking Phase\n                if (cycle >= 2400 && cycle < 2600) {\n                    loginBtn.style.backgroundColor = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)';\n                    loginBtn.style.transform = 'scale(0.96)';\n                }\n                // Success Phase\n                else if (cycle >= 2600 && cycle < 4000) {\n                    loginBtn.style.backgroundColor = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)';\n                    loginBtn.style.transform = 'scale(1)';\n                    loginBtn.style.borderColor = 'rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.3)';\n                    loginBtn.innerHTML = '<span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-emerald-400 scale-90\">Authorized</span>';\n                }\n                // Reset Phase\n                else {\n                    loginBtn.style.backgroundColor = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)';\n                    loginBtn.style.transform = 'scale(1)';\n                    loginBtn.style.borderColor = 'transparent';\n                    loginBtn.innerHTML = '<span class=\"text-xs font-normal scale-90\">Confirm Updates</span>';\n                }\n            }\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(animateLoop);\n        }\n\n        requestAnimationFrame(animateLoop);\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "authentication-architecture.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/authentication-architecture.jpg", "source_name": "authentication-architecture-DESIGN.md", "views": 292, "forks": 8, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T10:36:47.021702+00:00"}